config BR2_PACKAGE_TAILSCALE_BIN
	bool "tailscale-bin (official static binaries)"
	depends on BR2_x86_64
	help
	  Official prebuilt static Tailscale binaries (tailscaled + tailscale),
	  pinned to a current, audited release. Used instead of Buildroot's
	  in-tree tailscale package, which lags upstream and (at 1.78.1) predates
	  advisory TS-2025-008.

	  https://tailscale.com
